            ^"Effect" STRING "Activation: When making a Social skill (Fire) check targeting one or more characters, Koryusai may spend (op) in the following way:\n\nFire (op)+: One target gains the Dazed condition per (op) spent this way.\n\nFire (op) (op)+: One target gains the Enraged condition per (op) (op) spent this way."
        }
